      },
      "message": "feat(vector): add IDL operation for vmv.x.s instruction\n\nAdd the operation() implementation for the vmv.x.s (Vector Move Scalar\nto Integer Register) instruction.\n\nThe operation copies element 0 of vector register vs2 to integer\nregister xd, sign-extending to XLEN bits. This matches the Sail\nreference implementation already present in the spec file.\n\nAlso adds proper long_name and description fields.\n\nFixes #1692",
